.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Extends \fBILock\fP by exposing the underlying synchronization handle\&. This is useful for advanced scenarios where the caller may need direct access to the wrapped primitive (e\&.g\&., Mutex, Monitor object)\&. 


.PP
